[00:20.60]1. With dignity and joy,
[00:28.50]A threefold cord is bound.
[00:35.30]With God and men to witness,
[00:41.46]These sacred vows resound.
[00:48.18](Chorus 1)
[00:49.08]He vowed before Jehovah
[00:54.84]To love her from the heart.
[01:02.80]“What God has yoked together,
[01:08.62]Let no man put apart.”
[01:41.22]2. They both have searched God’s Word
[01:41.22]To learn to do his will,
[01:41.22]And now they seek his blessing,
[01:41.22]Their promise to fulfill.
[01:41.22](Chorus 2)
[01:41.22]She vowed before Jehovah
[01:46.36]To love him from the heart.
[01:53.32]“What God has yoked together,
[02:00.12]Let no man put apart.”
